      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s historic district, listed on the National Register, includes Aventine Hall, the former home of 19th‑century lawyer Peter Bouck Borst.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luray%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Isabella Furnace, once an iron works, was later renamed after the nearby river and now stands as a historic industrial site.",
